SUMMARY:KERRY BURCH: 5 POINTS GALLERY FEATURED ARTIST
DESCRIPTION:5 Points Gallery is pleased to present a nature-inspired exhibition of abstract paintings by Kerry Burch. Drawing from nature’s shapes\, contours\, and earthy tones\, her work combines bold color and layered texture to evoke shifting pathways and quiet moments found in the landscape. Join us for our Third Friday Opening Reception on May 15 from 6-9pm to meet the artist and experience this new body of work. Enjoy the varied creations of our ten Triangle-based artists working in painting\, sculpture\, fused glass\, mixed media\, and finely crafted furniture. The exhibition runs from May 14 through June 13. Image: Kerry Burch\, The Forest Floor\, Acrylic and Pastel\, 30 x 20 inches \nVisit 5 Points Gallery in person or online at https://5pointsgallery.com. All work from the exhibition is available for shipping or pickup. Gallery hours: Thursdays and Fridays 5–9pm\, Saturdays 1–9pm. Artists are available to talk about their work. For a private viewing\, contact us at info@5pointsgallery.com.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/kerry-burch-5-points-gallery-featured-artist-2/2026-05-28/
LOCATION:5 Points Gallery\, 109 E Chapel Hill St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Exhibit,Third Friday
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/5-Points-Gallery-Kerry-Burch-The-Forrest-Floor-4.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="5 Points Gallery":MAILTO:noreply@facebookmail.com
GEO:35.9970428;-78.9034674
