SUMMARY:Triangle Drag Night on the Roof
DESCRIPTION:Photo credit: @flynnvfphoto \nTriangle Drag Club takes over the Roof on Friday May 29th from 6-9 PM with a night of live drag performance hosted by Izzy A Problem. A rotating cast of 4–6 local queens brings the heat. A DJ sets the tone starting at 6 PM\, and the show kicks off at 7 PM. \nThe Roof’s full bar and small plates menu are available all night. Don’t miss the featured cocktail: Show Me Your Spritz — apricot-infused rum\, honey\, grapefruit\, prosecco\, soda\, pink glitter. $11. \nThis is one of those nights worth arriving early for. The Roof fills up. Bring cash to tip the queens. \nAbout Triangle Drag Club 🌈 The longest-running BIPOC drag show in the Triangle\, Triangle Drag Club spotlights local performers across the region\, building community and expanding visibility for artists at every stage of their career. Follow them on Instagram: @triangledrag.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/triangle-drag-night-on-the-roof/
LOCATION:The Durham Hotel\, 315 E Chapel Hill Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:LGBTQ,Live Performance
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Triangle-Drag-Night-TDH.jpg
